  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Pixel RPN Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n  <script src=\"app.js\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"calculator\" aria-labelledby=\"title\">\n    <header class=\"heading\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">POCKET TOOL · 01</span>\n      <h1 id=\"title\">Pixel RPN</h1>\n      <p>Push numbers. Work from the stack.</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"stack-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"stack-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading\">\n        <h2 id=\"stack-title\">Stack</h2>\n        <span id=\"stack-count\" class=\"stack-count\">0 values</span>\n      </div>\n      <ol id=\"stack\" class=\"stack\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions removals text\">\n        <li class=\"empty-state\">Your stack is empty</li>\n      </ol>\n      <p id=\"message\" class=\"message\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"keypad\" aria-label=\"Calculator controls\">\n      <div class=\"number-keys\" aria-label=\"Number keys\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-number=\"7\">7</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-number=\"8\">8</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-number=\"9\">9</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-number=\"4\">4</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-number=\"5\">5</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-number=\"6\">6</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-number=\"1\">1</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-number=\"2\">2</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-number=\"3\">3</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-number=\"0\" class=\"zero\">0</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-number=\".\" aria-label=\"Decimal point\">.</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"action-keys\" aria-label=\"Operations\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-operation=\"+\" aria-label=\"Add\">+</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-operation=\"-\" aria-label=\"Subtract\">−</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-operation=\"*\" aria-label=\"Multiply\">×</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-operation=\"/\" aria-label=\"Divide\">÷</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"footer-actions\">\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"enter\" class=\"enter-button\">Enter <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↵</span></button>\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"clear\" class=\"clear-button\">Clear stack</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"hint\">Keyboard: type a number, press Enter, or use + − * /</p>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": "Calculator page with labeled stack, keypad, and controls."
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  color-scheme: light;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: #183b36;\n  background: #dce9d7;\n  font-synthesis: none;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nbody {\n  min-width: 360px;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 32px 16px;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  background-color: #dce9d7;\n  background-image: radial-gradient(#bfd2bd 1px, transparent 1px);\n  background-size: 18px 18px;\n}\n\nbutton { font: inherit; }\n\n.calculator {\n  width: min(100%, 440px);\n  padding: 30px;\n  border: 3px solid #183b36;\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  background: #f8f5e9;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #183b36;\n}\n\n.heading { margin-bottom: 24px; }\n.eyebrow { color: #688d68; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.13em; }\nh1 { margin: 5px 0 2px; font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1.2; }\n.heading p { margin: 0; color: #55726a; }\n\n.stack-panel {\n  min-height: 150px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  border: 2px solid #183b36;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  background: #e9f1df;\n}\n.section-heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; }\nh2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; }\n.stack-count { color: #55726a; font-size: 0.875rem; }\n.stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column-reverse; gap: 6px; max-height: 156px; overflow-y: auto; margin: 12px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n.stack li { padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; background: #fffdf5; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: 700; }\n.stack li:first-child { border: 1px solid #91af8d; }\n.stack .empty-state { border: 0; background: transparent; color: #71877a; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; }\n.message { min-height: 1.25em; margin: 8px 0 0; color: #a44735; font-size: 0.9rem; }\n\n.keypad { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 70px; gap: 10px; margin-top: 18px; }\n.number-keys { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 8px; }\n.action-keys { display: grid; grid-template-rows: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 8px; }\n.keypad button, .footer-actions button { min-height: 52px; border: 2px solid #183b36; border-radius: 9px; color: #183b36; font-weight: 750; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 100ms ease, box-shadow 100ms ease, background 100ms ease; }\n.number-keys button { background: #fffdf5; font-size: 1.15rem; }\n.number-keys .zero { grid-column: span 2; }\n.action-keys button { background: #f2c66d; font-size: 1.35rem; }\n.footer-actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 10px; margin-top: 10px; }\n.footer-actions .enter-button { background: #183b36; color: #f8f5e9; }\n.enter-button span { margin-left: 6px; }\n.footer-actions .clear-button { padding: 0 15px; background: #f8f5e9; }\nbutton:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #183b36; }\nbutton:active { transform: translateY(1px); box-shadow: none; }\nbutton:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #c06b45; outline-offset: 3px; }\n.hint { margin: 16px 0 0; color: #55726a; font-size: 0.85rem; text-align: center; }\n\n[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\n@media (max-width: 420px) {\n  body { padding: 20px 14px; }\n  .calculator { padding: 22px 18px; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 #183b36; }\n  .keypad { grid-template-columns: 1fr 60px; }\n}\n",
      "description": "Responsive themed styling with visible focus, hover, and pressed states."
    },
    {
      "path": "app.js",
      "content": "const stack = [];\nconst stackList = document.querySelector(\"#stack\");\nconst countLabel = document.querySelector(\"#stack-count\");\nconst message = document.querySelector(\"#message\");\nlet entry = \"\";\n\nfunction render() {\n  stackList.replaceChildren();\n  if (stack.length === 0) {\n    const empty = document.createElement(\"li\");\n    empty.className = \"empty-state\";\n    empty.textContent = \"Your stack is empty\";\n    stackList.append(empty);\n  } else {\n    stack.forEach((value, index) => {\n      const item = document.createElement(\"li\");\n      item.textContent = `${index === stack.length - 1 ? \"TOP · \" : \"\"}${value}`;\n      stackList.append(item);\n    });\n  }\n  countLabel.textContent = `${stack.length} ${stack.length === 1 ? \"value\" : \"values\"}`;\n}\n\nfunction pushEntry() {\n  if (!entry || entry === \".\") return;\n  const value = Number(entry);\n  if (Number.isFinite(value)) stack.push(value);\n  entry = \"\";\n  render();\n}\n\nfunction operate(operator) {\n  pushEntry();\n  message.textContent = \"\";\n  if (stack.length < 2) {\n    message.textContent = \"Need two values to run that operation.\";\n    return;\n  }\n  const right = stack.pop();\n  const left = stack.pop();\n  let result;\n  if (operator === \"+\") result = left + right;\n  if (operator === \"-\") result = left - right;\n  if (operator === \"*\") result = left * right;\n  if (operator === \"/\") result = left / right;\n  if (!Number.isFinite(result)) {\n    message.textContent = \"That operation has no finite result.\";\n    stack.push(left, right);\n    render();\n    return;\n  }\n  stack.push(Number(result.toPrecision(12)));\n  render();\n}\n\nfunction addDigit(digit) {\n  message.textContent = \"\";\n  if (digit === \".\") {\n    if (!entry) entry = \"0\";\n    if (entry.includes(\".\")) return;\n  }\n  entry += digit;\n}\n\ndocument.querySelectorAll(\"[data-number]\").forEach(button => {\n  button.addEventListener(\"click\", () => addDigit(button.dataset.number));\n});\ndocument.querySelectorAll(\"[data-operation]\").forEach(button => {\n  button.addEventListener(\"click\", () => operate(button.dataset.operation));\n});\ndocument.querySelector(\"#enter\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  message.textContent = \"\";\n  if (!entry) {\n    message.textContent = \"Enter a number first.\";\n    return;\n  }\n  pushEntry();\n});\ndocument.querySelector(\"#clear\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  stack.length = 0;\n  entry = \"\";\n  message.textContent = \"\";\n  render();\n});\n\ndocument.addEventListener(\"keydown\", event => {\n  if (/^[0-9.]$/.test(event.key)) {\n    addDigit(event.key);\n  } else if (event.key === \"Enter\") {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    document.querySelector(\"#enter\").click();\n  } else if ([\"+\", \"-\", \"*\", \"/\"].includes(event.key)) {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    operate(event.key);\n  } else if (event.key === \"Escape\" || event.key.toLowerCase() === \"c\") {\n    document.querySelector(\"#clear\").click();\n  }\n});\n\nrender();\n",
      "description": "Plain JavaScript keypad and keyboard handling for stack operations."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel RPN Calculator\n\nAn offline reverse-Polish notation calculator built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript.\n\n## Run it\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server, installation, or network connection is needed.\n\n## Use it\n\n- Click number keys or type digits to enter a number, then press **Enter** to push it onto the stack.\n- Choose `+`, `−`, `×`, or `÷` to combine the top two stack values. The second value is the right operand for subtraction and division.\n- **Clear stack** empties the stack. Keyboard shortcuts are `Escape` or `C` to clear.\n- If an operation has fewer than two values, an error appears and the stack is preserved.\n",
      "description": "Instructions to run and use the offline calculator."
    }
  ]
}